<title>HONG KONG: Asia Financial 1996 net up 13.5 percent.</title>
<headline>Asia Financial 1996 net up 13.5 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   41.2   vs 36.8</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    9.0    vs 8.8</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    281.55 vs 248.04</p>
<p>    Turnover		     415.24 vs 396.43</p>
<p>    Company name		 Asia Financial Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  May 22-29</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   June 27</p>
<p>NOTE - Asia Financial an insurance and banking services group.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 15.5 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 6.5 cents) vs 15 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
